<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n50539" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἴξᾰλος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
		epith. of the Ibex,= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέλειος</span> acc. to <i><span class="en">
			Ar.Byz.
		</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
			Eust.
			1625.33
		</span></i>, or <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bounding,
			springing</i> (as Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>, etc.), or 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τομίας</span>
			 (as <i><span class="en">
				Porph.
			</span></i> ap. Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Il.
			</span></i>), 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἰξάλου αἰγὸς ἀγρίου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.105
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.32
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Agath.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				113
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Simm.
			</span></i>), <i><span class="en">
				9.99
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>). (Perh. borrowed fr. Asia Minor.)</div>
